{
  "script_id": "ruled-surfaces",
  "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
  "voice_key": "yunxi",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "ruled-surfaces",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/ruled-surfaces/yunxi/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.48,
      "size": 55728,
      "text": "拿一把直筷子，能不能摆出一个弯曲的面？听起来矛盾，但答案是可以，而且方法不止一种。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "ruled-surfaces",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/ruled-surfaces/yunxi/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.8,
      "size": 60768,
      "text": "由一族直线扫出的曲面叫直纹曲面。它的构造只需两样东西：一条准线，加上每点处那条直线的方向。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "ruled-surfaces",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/ruled-surfaces/yunxi/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.64,
      "size": 58176,
      "text": "写成公式就是准线加上参数乘方向。固定准线上的位置，让参数跑一遍，得到的必定是一条直线。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "ruled-surfaces",
      "section_id": "simple",
      "line_id": "sp-1",
      "filename": "simple-sp-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/ruled-surfaces/yunxi/simple-sp-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.54,
      "size": 56592,
      "text": "先看圆柱面。准线是一个圆，方向永远竖直向上。所有直线互相平行，扫出一个筒。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "ruled-surfaces",
      "section_id": "simple",
      "line_id": "sp-2",
      "filename": "simple-sp-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/ruled-surfaces/yunxi/simple-sp-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.93,
      "size": 46944,
      "text": "再看圆锥面。这次所有直线都过同一个顶点，方向随准线位置转动，扫出一个锥。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "ruled-surfaces",
      "section_id": "simple",
      "line_id": "sp-3",
      "filename": "simple-sp-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/ruled-surfaces/yunxi/simple-sp-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.36,
      "size": 53712,
      "text": "这两种有个共同的好处：它们都能不撕不皱地摊平成一张平面。裁缝和钣金工天天在用这个性质。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "ruled-surfaces",
      "section_id": "notdev",
      "line_id": "nd-1",
      "filename": "notdev-nd-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/ruled-surfaces/yunxi/notdev-nd-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.62,
      "size": 41904,
      "text": "但请注意，不是所有直纹面都能摊平。这是初学时最容易搞混的一点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "ruled-surfaces",
      "section_id": "notdev",
      "line_id": "nd-2",
      "filename": "notdev-nd-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/ruled-surfaces/yunxi/notdev-nd-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.84,
      "size": 61488,
      "text": "看螺旋面。它确实由水平直线扫出，是标准的直纹面。可它的高斯曲率处处为负，怎么压都压不平。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "ruled-surfaces",
      "section_id": "notdev",
      "line_id": "nd-3",
      "filename": "notdev-nd-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/ruled-surfaces/yunxi/notdev-nd-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.59,
      "size": 57456,
      "text": "单叶双曲面也是如此，它甚至有两族直线。冷却塔用它是因为能用直钢筋施工，而不是因为能摊平。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "ruled-surfaces",
      "section_id": "criterion",
      "line_id": "cr-1",
      "filename": "criterion-cr-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/ruled-surfaces/yunxi/criterion-cr-1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.04,
      "size": 64656,
      "text": "怎么严格区分？有一个干净的行列式判据。把准线的导数、方向向量、方向的导数三个向量排成行列式。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "ruled-surfaces",
      "section_id": "criterion",
      "line_id": "cr-2",
      "filename": "criterion-cr-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/ruled-surfaces/yunxi/criterion-cr-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.97,
      "size": 63504,
      "text": "行列式恒等于零，曲面可展，高斯曲率处处为零。行列式不为零，曲面不可展，高斯曲率为负。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "ruled-surfaces",
      "section_id": "criterion",
      "line_id": "cr-3",
      "filename": "criterion-cr-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/ruled-surfaces/yunxi/criterion-cr-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.78,
      "size": 60480,
      "text": "屏幕上显示的就是这个行列式的实时数值。圆柱和圆锥精确为零，螺旋面和双曲面明显不为零。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "ruled-surfaces",
      "section_id": "mobius",
      "line_id": "mb-1",
      "filename": "mobius-mb-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/ruled-surfaces/yunxi/mobius-mb-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.06,
      "size": 48960,
      "text": "最后看一个特别的例子。莫比乌斯带也是直纹面，准线是一个圆，但方向有个巧妙的设计。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "ruled-surfaces",
      "section_id": "mobius",
      "line_id": "mb-2",
      "filename": "mobius-mb-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/ruled-surfaces/yunxi/mobius-mb-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.71,
      "size": 59328,
      "text": "方向绕行一周时只翻转半圈。请留意这个细节：走完一整圈回到起点，方向却和出发时正好相反。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "ruled-surfaces",
      "section_id": "mobius",
      "line_id": "mb-3",
      "filename": "mobius-mb-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/ruled-surfaces/yunxi/mobius-mb-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.78,
      "size": 44496,
      "text": "必须再走一圈方向才复原。这个半圈的错位正是莫比乌斯带只有一个面的根源。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "ruled-surfaces",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/ruled-surfaces/yunxi/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.5,
      "size": 40032,
      "text": "第一，直纹曲面由准线加方向构造，固定准线位置必得一条直线。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "ruled-surfaces",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/ruled-surfaces/yunxi/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.66,
      "size": 42624,
      "text": "第二，直纹不等于可展。圆柱圆锥能摊平，螺旋面与双曲面不能。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "ruled-surfaces",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/ruled-surfaces/yunxi/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.72,
      "size": 59472,
      "text": "第三，判据是准线导数、方向、方向导数三者的行列式是否恒为零。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
